\description{
Loads every team id and name another source uses for an
ESPN team, with the seasons the source shows it on that team. Use it to
map a Fox, Yahoo, CBS, 247Sports, On3, KenPom, Torvik, NCAA or NBA Stats
team id or name onto the ESPN \code{team_id}. A source id means something
only within its source (Fox 25 is not ESPN 25), so always join on
\code{source} as well. \code{load_mbb_team_aliases()} reads the \code{mbb_groups}
release tag and \code{load_nba_team_aliases()} the \code{nba_groups} tag.

See \code{\link[=load_mbb_player_aliases]{load_mbb_player_aliases()}} for player ids and
\code{\link[=load_mbb_group_aliases]{load_mbb_group_aliases()}} for conference and division aliases.
}
